{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_007_03_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7d735317fc074598b4036684fdd9a2a0484908f4e2028dee4d886916839bb30c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b77699b029f2563cbb2da0a8b6c4b2a840faa20485dbcd74f1c623e121705fd2",
      "text": "我这边的问题就这些了。\n社长，您对两位有什么想提问的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41eee7890d27834ea20ba4f2a68f368a96cd9e25f9b6d48f9af48f3a5fdd0659",
      "text": "嗯。那么我也来问个问题吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:345751e6863e68615d1ed80faa5e3ad9a52751f7a2b06d3f86af6c164d67197f",
      "text": "你们两位，\n为什么会想要成为偶像呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22f2df93845a3943232f3e4a88a4dd4eefa584dd563782e813b73aff0a54abb9",
      "text": "我是为了……成为偶像，以我自己的方式\n将茶道推广给更多的人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25432720663b03c24e14a8a920c5247ceac11fe02a9b07ca1363cd9b89f4ead4",
      "text": "坚守先辈的教诲，\n我也十分清楚这是我的本分。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_e:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51246a5dd2529982c16fc2226c54c8d79d563a36927f9528a0a647626e95b09b",
      "text": "但是我，不仅想在门内敞开大门，\n更想亲自走出门去迎接众人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_e:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38301203c943e52d291ea6f326df6f6a0a2a83696d1d1c5257aed01c76e5a49d",
      "text": "（……不能只受茶道传统的束缚，\n还必须吸收新的东西）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_e:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:754d83bafdfdec4cb7b7a3b59a7bac429238b851a5f1bae60f6beb8b863685ca",
      "text": "以此为契机，我便想成为偶像。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_e:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de06093f42019218666dce08bd1ff49e33570ed7a4778699aa404cdd60717c71",
      "text": "（是个认真思考茶道未来、踏实认真的孩子呢。\n……要在这个圈子里生存，未免太耿直了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_e:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d9614a89be04ad022f89d0f039a1b502452d05fbc1db147070a954dfd1704b1",
      "text": "（但是……是个让人很舒服的孩子呢。\n正因为率真，才值得信赖）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
